doc:Predictive_Maintenance_Article schema:abstract "In condition monitoring, the reliability of a predictive maintenance program is critically dependent on the precision of data obtained from measurement systems. This study proposes a systematic framework for evaluating measurement-system capability using Gage repeatability and reproducibility, judging acceptability and guiding system selection."@en .
